=Extract marksheet data from OCR into the exact JSON schema below. Output ONLY JSON, no markdown.
Rules: 1. Guess nothing; use null for missing fields. 2. Marks, totals, %, and CGPA must be numbers. 3. Extract all subjects. 4. Format theory/practical/total as {"obtained":num,"maximum":num} or null. 5. If only total marks exist, map to total. 6. Calc missing % to 2 decimals. 7. summary.result = PASS/FAIL/printed result. 8. document_type="marksheet".

OCR: {{ $json.cleanedText }}

Schema:
{"document_type":"marksheet","student":{"name":null,"roll_number":null,"registration_number":null,"date_of_birth":null},"institution":{"name":null,"board":null,"course":null,"semester":null},"subjects":[{"name":null,"code":null,"theory":{"obtained":null,"maximum":null},"practical":null,"total":{"obtained":null,"maximum":null},"grade":null}],"summary":{"total_obtained":null,"total_maximum":null,"percentage":null,"cgpa":null,"result":null}}

